Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs11\pos(191.2,161.067)\fnGeorgia}Maomao's Diaries
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs36\c&H55B0E6&\3c&H204060&\blur3\t(0,300,\fscx120\fscy120)\t(0,300,\fscx100\fscy100)\pos(187.733,243.2)}Mercury
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.30,0:00:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}*Sigh*{\i0}... \NThat woman called Pai Nyan-Nyan...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.77,0:00:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth was she trying to achieve by \Ntricking rich people with such an elaborate setup?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.76,0:00:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.88,0:00:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You again...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As blunt and rude as ever, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.05,0:00:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trick-unraveling performance \Nback there was magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.00,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone could figure that out if they just gave it a little thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.05,0:00:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But isn't it boring to just figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If you can figure out the trick, \Nthat means you can reproduce it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.44,0:00:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth are you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.12,0:00:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Doing the exact same thing wouldn't be \Naesthetically pleasing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I know! To rival Pai Nyan-Nyan, \Nhow about "{\i1}Ryuu Maomao{\i0}" (Green Maomao)?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs20\b1\c&H3F9B6F&\3c&HFFFFFF&\blur2\pos(313.6,256)}G\n\NR\N\nE\N\nE\n\NN\n\n\NM\N\nA\N\nO\N\nM\N\nA\N\nO\N
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs12\pos(179.2,35.556)}Lakan's attendant suggests that Maomao launch a rival act against the fake "Pai Nyan-Nyan" by calling herself "Ryuu Maomao" (緑猫猫) and dressing up as the "Fairy of All Cures" covered in medicinal herbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.96,0:00:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Maomao: Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.20,0:00:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You deck yourself out in medicinal herbs and promote yourself as the Fairy of All Cures!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It lacks a bit of glamour, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This guy...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.43,0:01:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,According to my calculations...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.25,0:01:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6F9B3F&\pos(219.6,32)\t(0,300,\fscx120\fscy120)\t(300,600,\fscx100\fscy100)}Time for Maomao's Trivia!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.70,0:01:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,1000)\fs11\c&H142041&\2c&HE8F3F5&\3c&HF5F5F5&\4c&HE5F3F8&\pos(220.16,68.693)}Mercury
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.80,0:01:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mercury. A metallic substance capable of changing its shape remarkably, such as into liquid or solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Due to its unique properties, it was thought to be effective for transforming into an immortal, and was believed to be a key ingredient in alchemy elixirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.50,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,, It is highly toxic, so you must never consume it under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this looks like it'll bring in a huge profit!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, you don't actually have to drink the mercury.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.84,0:01:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\pos(190.933,248.178)}\N{\fnGeorgia\pos(189.6,244.8)}{\fs25\3c&HFFFFFF&\4c&H232323&\c&H000000&\2c&HFFFFFF&}Next time: \NThe Paper Village
